---
// "About the blogger" card at the bottom of every blog post, including guest posts (a guest's own bio and link
// stay inside the post itself).
---
<section class="about-blogger grid items-center gap-8 rounded-[2rem] bg-[#e9d9ec] p-8 sm:grid-cols-[240px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-12 sm:p-12">
  <img src="/images/kylie-headshot.jpg" alt="Kylie Kelly" width="170" height="226" loading="lazy" class="mx-auto h-auto w-48 rounded-2xl object-cover object-top sm:w-full" />
  <div>
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-semibold mb-3">About the blogger</p>
    <p class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold italic leading-tight mb-4 sm:text-5xl">Hey there...<br />I'm Kylie Kelly</p>
    <p class="mb-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed">I'm an ex international wedding photographer turned email marketing educator and the host of The Email Growth Show. I grew my list from 0 to 7,000+ subscribers in 18 months without social media, and I share how, every Friday.</p>
    <a href="/meet-kylie" class="inline-block rounded-full bg-black px-6 py-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-white transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">Meet Kylie →</a>
  </div>
</section>
